    "python": "import sys\ndata = sys.stdin.read().split()\nn = int(data[0]); i = 1\ncs = []\nfor _ in range(n):\n    cs.append(tuple(map(int, data[i:i + 4]))); i += 4\na = int(data[i]); b = int(data[i + 1])\nans = -1\nfor idx, (x, y, g, k) in enumerate(cs, 1):\n    if x <= a <= x + g and y <= b <= y + k:\n        ans = idx\nprint(ans)",
