    "java": "String x=sc.next(),y=sc.next();\nStringBuilder r=new StringBuilder(); int carry=0, i=x.length()-1, j=y.length()-1;\nwhile(i>=0||j>=0||carry>0){ int t=carry; if(i>=0)t+=x.charAt(i--)-'0'; if(j>=0)t+=y.charAt(j--)-'0'; r.insert(0,(char)(t%10+'0')); carry=t/10; }\nSystem.out.println(r);"
