    "python": "s=input().strip()\nlast={};L=0;ans=0\nfor R,ch in enumerate(s):\n    if ch in last:L=max(L,last[ch]+1)\n    last[ch]=R\n    ans=max(ans,R-L+1)\nprint(ans)",
    "java": "String s=sc.next();int n=s.length();int[]last=new int[256];java.util.Arrays.fill(last,-1);int L=0,ans=0;for(int R=0;R<n;R++){char ch=s.charAt(R);if(last[ch]>=L)L=last[ch]+1;last[ch]=R;ans=Math.max(ans,R-L+1);}System.out.println(ans);"
