  "desc": "果园今天采摘了一批水果，户主想请你写程序：编辑距离指把一个字符数列变成另一个所需的最少单字符插入/删除/替换次数。输入两串，打印编辑距离中间过程请优先用长整型，避免中途溢出。",
  "input": "两行，各一个字符串（长度 ≤ 1000）",
  "output": "一行：编辑距离",
  "samples": [
    {
      "input": "ccaba\nabccbcacaacaaabccaaacabcaabbca",
      "output": "25"
    }
  ],
  "solutions": {
    "cpp": "string a,b;cin>>a>>b;int n=a.size(),m=b.size();vector<vector<int>>dp(n+1,vector<int>(m+1));for(int i=0;i<=n;i++)dp[i][0]=i;for(int j=0;j<=m;j++)dp[0][j]=j;for(int i=1;i<=n;i++)for(int j=1;j<=m;j++)dp[i][j]=min({dp[i-1][j]+1,dp[i][j-1]+1,dp[i-1][j-1]+(a[i-1]!=b[j-1])});cout<<dp[n][m]<<'\\n';",
    "python": "a=input().strip();b=input().strip()\nn,m=len(a),len(b)\ndp=[[0]*(m+1) for _ in range(n+1)]\nfor i in range(n+1):dp[i][0]=i\nfor j in range(m+1):dp[0][j]=j\nfor i in range(1,n+1):\n    for j in range(1,m+1):\n        dp[i][j]=min(dp[i-1][j]+1,dp[i][j-1]+1,dp[i-1][j-1]+(a[i-1]!=b[j-1]))\nprint(dp[n][m])",
    "java": "String a=sc.next(),b=sc.next();int n=a.length(),m=b.length();int[][]dp=new int[n+1][m+1];for(int i=0;i<=n;i++)dp[i][0]=i;for(int j=0;j<=m;j++)dp[0][j]=j;for(int i=1;i<=n;i++)for(int j=1;j<=m;j++)dp[i][j]=Math.min(Math.min(dp[i-1][j]+1,dp[i][j-1]+1),dp[i-1][j-1]+(a.charAt(i-1)!=b.charAt(j-1)));System.out.println(dp[n][m]);"
  }
