    "cpp": "#include<iostream>\n#include<string>\nusing namespace std;\nint main(){string s;cin>>s;\nlong long ans=-1;for(int i=0;i<(int)s.size();i++)if(s[i]=='a'||s[i]=='e'||s[i]=='i'||s[i]=='o'||s[i]=='u'){ans=i;break;}\ncout<<ans<<endl;return 0;}\n",
    "python": "import sys\ns=sys.stdin.readline().strip()\nans=-1\nfor i,c in enumerate(s):\n if c in \"aeiou\": ans=i; break\nprint(ans)\n",
