  "desc": "先读题，再写程序。快递柜后台要统计取件情况，需要你写程序：把整型数 n 写成 base 进制，算出各位数字之和（举个例子 13 在二进制下是 1101，和为 3）。\n本题要求代码简洁，超过三十行也能过但不鼓励。",
  "input": "第一行 n（1 ≤ n ≤ 10¹⁸），第二行进制 base（2 ≤ base ≤ 16）",
  "output": "一个整数，数码之和",
  "samples": [
    {
      "input": "320644903397009999\n8",
      "output": "59"
    },
    {
      "input": "278364189525345824\n8",
      "output": "68"
    },
    {
      "input": "286780064765373920\n8",
      "output": "69"
    }
  ],
  "solutions": {
    "cpp": "long long n;cin>>n;int base;cin>>base;long long c=0;\nwhile(n){c+=n%base;n/=base;}cout<<c<<'\\n';",
    "python": "n=int(input())\nbase=int(input())\nc=0\nwhile n:\n    c+=n%base\n    n//=base\nprint(c)",
    "java": "long n=sc.nextLong();int base=sc.nextInt();long c=0;\nwhile(n!=0){c+=n%base;n/=base;}System.out.println(c);"
  }
